# 04 - IP Addressing Plan

One /24 per VLAN from 10.34.0.0/16. Router0 sub-interfaces (Gi0/0.x) are the .1 gateway of each subnet.

| VLAN | Name | Subnet | Gateway | DHCP range |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 10 | Management | 10.34.10.0/24 | 10.34.10.1 | .21 onward |
| 20 | Conveyancing | 10.34.20.0/24 | 10.34.20.1 | .21 onward |
| 30 | Admin/Finance | 10.34.30.0/24 | 10.34.30.1 | .21 onward |
| 40 | Reception | 10.34.40.0/24 | 10.34.40.1 | .21 onward |
| 50 | Servers | 10.34.50.0/24 | 10.34.50.1 | Static (server 10.34.50.10) |
| 60 | Guest Wi-Fi | 10.34.60.0/24 | 10.34.60.1 | .21 onward |
| 70 | Contractor Wi-Fi (CR14) | 10.34.70.0/24 | 10.34.70.1 | .21 onward |
| 99 | Native/trunk | 10.34.99.0/24 | None | No hosts |

DHCP starts at .21 so the static management addresses never collide with client leases.

